{"id":"n37076-1-5","stage":3,"title":"그저 · 一直","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n37076-1-5-1","ko":"승규는 지금 뭐해요?","zh":"承奎现在在做什么？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"승규는","meaning":"承奎","explanation":"승규：承奎；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"승규는","audio":"/audio/8cca37774e5e7081db86.mp3"}],"sources":[],"surfaceReading":{"term":"승규는","audio":"/audio/8cca37774e5e7081db86.mp3"}},{"text":"지금","meaning":"现在","explanation":"지금：现在。","readings":[{"term":"지금","audio":"/audio/df159f47a890ff655039.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62522","senseId":"1","lemma":"지금","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"지금","audio":"/audio/df159f47a890ff655039.mp3"}},{"text":"뭐해요?","meaning":"什么；做，干","explanation":"뭐：什么；하다：做，干；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"뭐","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3"},{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"84991","senseId":"1","lemma":"뭐","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"},{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"뭐해요","audio":"/audio/7881ac4b561fffc272e2.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"df159f47a890ff65","term":"지금","zh":"现在","audio":"/audio/df159f47a890ff655039.mp3","entryId":"62522","definition":"指正在说话的此时。","pronunciation":["지금"]},{"id":"95b5c8cf1b249b7a","term":"뭐","zh":"什么","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3","entryId":"84991","definition":"指代不知道的事实或事物。","pronunciation":["뭐ː"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"做，干","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"进行某种行动、动作或活动。","pronunciation":["하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/6cd04c0d7412388828dd.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n37076-1-5-2","ko":"해가 중천에 떴는데도 그저 잠만 자고 있어.","zh":"太阳都高挂天空了，他还只是在睡觉。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"해가","meaning":"太阳","explanation":"해：太阳；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"해","audio":"/audio/b4ec4274b7799f1f17e5.mp3"}],"sources":[{